      "compound_name": "tetrakis(dysprosium(III)) tetrakis(manganese(III)) hydroxido-acetate-salicylhydroxamate-salicylate metallacrown-like cluster",
      "formula": "[Dy4III Mn4III (OH)2 (O2C2H3)3 (shi)4 (H2shi)4 (Hsal)3 (DMF)4]·3DMF",
      "ccdc_numbers": [
